{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink doorbell feels like a useful next addition because it connects my earlier interest in door alarms with my recent Alexa devices.",
    "Echo Auto offers a different use for Alexa, while the memory card connects to my past cards and card reader; both interest me if compatibility and a specific need are confirmed."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Older Echo Dot and Show 5 models feel redundant after my recent interactions with newer versions and a Show 5 stand; even the larger Show 8 needs a clear purpose.",
    "Desktop memory and an internal SSD assume an upgrade project I have not shown, while the USB-C accessories assume devices and connection needs I have not established."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Alexa seems to have been taken as a reason to suggest more Echo devices regardless of what they add to my recent setup.",
    "My history with computer accessories and storage seems to have been stretched into interest in any computer component or cable."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent device generations and matching stand matter because they make older replacements less useful right now.",
    "I need a practical use and compatible equipment before choosing an accessory; my external drive and card reader history gives me more reason to consider removable storage than internal upgrades."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my Alexa and practical electronics interests, but miss the difference between a useful addition, a redundant device, and an upgrade I have no current reason to make."
}"}
